  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=833415), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11740963)\n\nI was the protagonist—until I met Guwon that day.\n\nIn the early 2000s, 'Taehee,' a cheerful and confident girl popular among her peers, takes pity on 'Guwon,' a loner who transfers to her school, and becomes her closest friend.\nHowever, as time goes on, Guwon starts to become more beautiful and gradually attracts everyone's attention. Taehee begins to notice a subtle change in the way Guwon treats her.\nDoes Guwon truly see Taehee as her best friend, or is she being sly?\nA story about the turbulent adolescence of young girls navigating friendships and emotions.",
